  What to do with a non co-alignded priest/priestess.

  You can buy protection from a non co-aligned priest/priestess. I usually
give all my gold to one of the non co-aligned priest/priestesses. After
I have cleared out the castle and the valley of the dead I take the rest
of my gold and buy more protection. When all the gold is used up simply
convert the altar, kill the priest/priestess, and proceed to the next
non co-aligned altar. Once all non co-aligned altars have been used up,
(Including Moloch's), then and only then buy protection from a co-aligned
altar. I have gotten -25 intrinsic armor class this way :-).

